Test Case: disk_os_basic
================================================================================

Step 3 Failed - Module Validation Cycle Error

Initial Error (Step 3 - terraform plan after switching to AzAPI):
╷
│ Error: Cycle: module.replicator.var.priority (validation), module.replicator.var.eviction_policy (validation)
│
│
╵
╷
│ Error: Cycle: module.replicator.var.patch_assessment_mode (validation), module.replicator.var.provision_vm_agent (validation), module.replicator.var.bypass_platform_safety_checks_on_user_schedule_enabled (validation), module.replicator.var.patch_mode (validation), module.replicator.var.os_managed_disk_id (validation)
│
│
